{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2860","id":2973187656,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz886xNz5I","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2860","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2860.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2860.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2860","number":2860,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Configurable email_verified OIDC Claim Requirement","user":{"login":"ImpostorKeanu","id":11574161,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTc0MTYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11574161?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpostorKeanu","html_url":"https://github.com/ImpostorKeanu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpostorKeanu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpostorKeanu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpostorKeanu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpostorKeanu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpostorKeanu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpostorKeanu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpostorKeanu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpostorKeanu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImpostorKeanu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nHeadscale is \"Open Source, acknowledged contribution\", this means that any\r\ncontribution will have to be discussed with the Maintainers before being submitted.\r\n\r\nThis model has been chosen to reduce the risk of burnout by limiting the\r\nmaintenance overhead of reviewing and validating third-party code.\r\n\r\nHeadscale is open to code contributions for bug fixes without discussion.\r\n\r\nIf you find mistakes in the documentation, please submit a fix to the documentation.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n<!-- Please tick if the following things apply. You… -->\r\n\r\n- [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\r\n- [ ] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\r\n- [x] added unit tests\r\n- [ ] added integration tests\r\n- [ ] updated documentation if needed\r\n- [ ] updated CHANGELOG.md\r\n\r\n<!-- If applicable, please reference the issue using `Fixes #XXX` and add tests to cover your new code. -->\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWhen configured to use OIDC, `email_verified=true` is required to appear in ID token claims or user info before the email will be saved in a user's information. There are some scenarios where the `email_verified` claim cannot be sent/configured, such as when using [Cloudflare One-time pin][cloudflare-otp] -- which doesn't support adding/modifying claims. This can make writing ACLs difficult or impossible.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a configuration that relaxes the  `email_verified=true` requirement by:\r\n\r\n- adding a configuration field: `oidc.use_unverified_email`\r\n- considering the setting when:\r\n  - applying `oidc.allowed_domains` during authorization\r\n  - user records are initialized via `User.FromClaim`\r\n\r\nRelated: #2655 \r\n\r\n[cloudflare-otp]: https://developers.cloudflare.com/cloudflare-one/integrations/identity-providers/one-time-pin/","created_at":"2025-11-03T15:39:27Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T11:42:32Z","closed_at":"2025-12-18T11:42:32Z","merged_at":"2025-12-18T11:42:32Z","merge_commit_sha":"7be20912f5861ef9d6fa42a615e44e6c0b0f2c17","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/